00:58:52,941 --> 00:58:58,941
Young Einstein is a 1988 Australian comedy film written,
produced, directed by and starring Yahoo Serious.

12
01:04:14,117 --> 01:04:20,117
It is a fantasized account of the life of Albert Einstein which alters all people, places and circumstances of his life, including relocating
the theoretical physicist to Australia, having him splitting the atom with a chisel, and inventing rock and roll and surfing.

13
01:09:35,294 --> 01:09:41,294
Although highly successful in Australia, and winning an award from the Australian Film
Institute Awards, it was poorly received by critics in the United States.

14
01:14:56,470 --> 01:15:02,470
At the APRA Music Awards of 1990, the soundtrack won
Most Performed Australasian Work for Film.

15
01:20:17,647 --> 01:20:23,647
The film explores themes of rock 'n' roll, atomic bomb,
nobel prize, marie curie, tasmanian.

16
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
